{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["葡萄樹的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，葡萄木比林中其他木材更好嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["葡萄木有什麼用呢？能用它製造掛鉤掛東西嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["看啊，它只能用來當柴燒。如果火已經燒了它的兩頭，中間也燒黑了，它還有什麼用呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["看啊，它完好無損的時候，尚且毫無用處，被火燒後黑豈不更沒用了嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以，主耶和華說：我怎樣把林中的葡萄樹扔進火中當柴燒，也必照樣丟棄耶路撒冷的居民。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我必嚴懲他們。他們縱然火裡逃生，仍要被火燒滅。我嚴懲他們的時候，他們便知道我是耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我必使他們的土地荒涼，因為他們對我不忠。這是主耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}